<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to midweek prices last week, slaughter steers, heifers and Holstein steers closed $.50-1.00 per CWT lower, USDA said. Supply: 800 head.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1200-1450 lbs 64.50-66.00.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 63.00-64.50. Select 2-3 1075-1350 lbs 58.50-63.00.</p>
<p>Holstein Steers: Choice 2-3 1300-1600 lbs 60.00-62.25.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-3 1200-1500 lbs 58.00-60.00. Select 1-2 1100-1500 lbs 53.50-58.00. Standard 1-2 50.00-53.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 1100-1250 lbs 64.00-65.00. Lot Select and Choice 2-3 1176 lbs 63.75.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
